  "details": "Similar to PhysBones & Contacts, please provide the option to set the interactive permissions of items in the new Item system *on a per-spawned item basis.*\n\nI.E\n\n- Anyone: Anyone can grab and interact with your item\n\n- Only Friends: Only friends can interact with your item\n\n- Only You: Only you can interact with your item\n\nThis would include the ability to grab said item.\n\nA *default* setting would be added to the Quick Menu, which designates an item's default permissions *when spawned from the action menu.*\n\n**When spawned from the inventory menu,** there would be an option…\n\n- Provided beneath the spawn button, as either similar to the \"Avatar Allowed to Interact\" element, a radio control, or dropdown; **or…**\n\n- As 3 separate buttons labeled \"Spawn for Everyone\", \"Spawn for my Friends\", & \"Spawn for Just Me\"\n\nLikewise, a similar control would exist in the item management menu (shown when highlighting an item with the quick menu open and selecting it.)",
